  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Griffith David vs Kadinnamkulam Grama ... on 4 June, 2024 W. P. (C) Nos. 8298 & 1910 of 2024 ..1.. In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr.Justice Mohammed Nias C.P. Tuesday, The 4Th Day Of June 2024 / 14Th Jyaishta, 1946 Wp(C) No. 8298 Of 2024 Petitioner: Eugine, Aged 41 Years, S/O Loordh Jacob, Aji Cottage, St.Andrews, St.Xavier'S College P.O, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695586. By Adv. Sri. L.Rajesh Narayan Respondents: 1 State Of Kerala, Rep By Secretary Local Self Government Department Secretariat, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695001 . 2 Secretary, Kadinnamkulam Grama Panchayath Kazhakoottam, Chittatumuku P.O, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695301. 3 Griffith David, S/O Gregory David, Residing At 27/1395(1) Rishimandalam, Vanchiyoor P.O, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695035. Sri.Syamanthak B.S., Gp This Writ Petition (Civil) Having Been Finally Heard On 04.06.2024, Along With Wp(C).No.1910/2024, The Court On The Same Day Delivered The Following: W. P. (C) Nos. 8298 & 1910 of 2024 ..2.. Griffith David vs Kadinnamkulam Grama ... on 4 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/112648896/ 1 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr.Justice Mohammed Nias C.P. Tuesday, The 4Th Day Of June 2024 / 14Th Jyaishta, 1946 Wp(C) No. 1910 Of 2024 Petitioner: Griffith David, Aged 55 Years, S/O. Gregory David, Presently Residing At 27/1395 (1), Rishimandalam, Vanchiyoor P.O, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695035 . By Advs.M/S.Mohan Jacob George, P.V.Parvathy, Reena Thomas, Nigi George & Ananthu V.Lal Respondents: 1 Kadinnamkulam Grama Panchayath, Represented By Its Secretary, Kazhakoottam, Menamkulam, Chittatumuku P.O, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695301. 2 Secretary, Kadinnamkulam Grama Panchayath, Kazhakoottam, Menamkulam, Chittatumuku P.O, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695301. 3 Kerala Coastal Zone Management Authority, Represented By Its Secretary, Thambanoor, Ksrtc Building, 4 Th Floor, Overbridge Thambanoor, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695001. 4 Eugine,Christuraja Engineering Works, St. Andrews, St. Xaviers College P.O, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695586. Sri.Prakash M P, Sc For R3 Adv. Sri.L.Rajesh Narayan, For R4 Sri.Syamanthak B.S., Gp This Writ Petition (Civil) Having Been Finally Heard On 04.06.2024, Along With Wp(C).No.8298/2024, The Court On The Same Day Delivered The Following: W. P. (C) Nos. 8298 & 1910 of 2024 ..3.. Mohammed Nias C. P. , J. ============================= W. P. (C) Nos. 8298 & 1910 of 2024 Griffith David vs Kadinnamkulam Grama ... on 4 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/112648896/ 2 ============================= Dated this the 4th day of June, 2024 Judgment In Wp(C) No. 8298/2024, the writ petitioner challenges the provisional order directing the demolition of a building. Wp(C) No. 1910/2024 was filed to direct the Panchayat to take appropriate action ag ainst the illegal construction allegedly made by the petitioner in the connected case . 2. This Court passed an order on 1.4.2024 directing the second respondent to take a final decision after hearing the petitioners in both cases.",
